<BaseLayout title="Braces Cost & Financing in Memphis | Hoffman Family Orthodontics" description="Understand orthodontic costs, insurance questions, and flexible payment options at Hoffman Family Orthodontics. Start with a complimentary East Memphis consultation.">
<main id="main" class="interior-page">
  <section class="detail-intro"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Cost &amp; Financing</p><h1>Your First Step<br>Is Free.</h1><p class="intro-lead">Your consultation with Dr. Rachel Hoffman is complimentary. We accept most insurance providers and offer flexible payment plans. At your first visit, you’ll receive your exact treatment fee in writing.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/#form">Plan Your Complimentary Consultation</a></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container detail-grid"><aside class="detail-sidebar"><p class="section-kicker">A Comfortable Place to Start</p><p>Your first consultation is complimentary. Bring your questions and your dental insurance information.</p><a class="text-link" href="/new-patients/">What to Expect at Your First Visit</a></aside><div class="detail-body">
    <section class="reading-copy"><h2>How Much Do Braces Cost in Memphis?</h2><p>At Hoffman Family Orthodontics, your complimentary consultation includes an exam and a personalized treatment recommendation. You’ll get the exact fee for your treatment in writing at that first visit, with an explanation of what is included.</p><p>Dr. Rachel will walk you through the options for your smile. Our team will help you understand your insurance benefits and payment choices before you decide to begin treatment.</p></section>
    <section class="reading-copy"><h2>We’ll Help with Insurance.</h2><p>We accept most insurance providers. Bring your dental insurance information to your consultation, and our team will help you understand your orthodontic benefits and how they apply to your treatment.</p><p>Coverage varies by plan. We’ll review the details with you so you can see what insurance may contribute and what your share will be.</p></section>
    <section class="reading-copy"><h2>Flexible Ways to Pay.</h2><p>We offer flexible payment plans to help make orthodontic care fit your family’s budget. At your first visit, our team will explain the payment options available for your treatment.</p><p>You’ll have a chance to review your fee, discuss the payment schedule, and ask questions before moving forward.</p></section>
    <section class="reading-copy"><h2>Compare the Whole Plan.</h2><p>When comparing braces and clear aligners, consider the proposed care, expected visits, and what happens after active treatment. Ask how retainers and follow-up care are handled so you can make an informed decision.</p><div class="inline-links"><a class="text-link" href="/treatments/">Explore Treatments</a><a class="text-link" href="/faq/#cost-and-planning">More Payment Questions</a></div></section>
  </div></div></section><ConsultationCTA title="Bring Your Questions. We’ll Bring Clarity." description="Arrange a complimentary consultation at our East Memphis office to discuss your treatment and payment options." />
</main>
